  "releaseNotes": "v10.0.0: Adds a Dafny-verified synchronous protocol core for header parsing, fragmentation decisions, outgoing framing and masking, and handshake/Close acceptance predicates. Tightens malformed-frame and handshake validation, corrects fragmentation metadata and final-continuation FIN handling, and validates text and Close payloads. Adds DafnyRuntime 4.11.0. See the README and docs/protocol-verification.md for proof boundaries and upgrade implications.",
